      "heading_path": [
        "Buyer's Guide Other planning considerations - Official Languages obligation",
        "Buyer's Guide"
      ],
      "markdown": "Official languages obligations The government must serve and communicate with the public in both official languages, as required by the Official Languages Act and its regulations, including the Official Languages (Communications with and Services to the Public) Regulations . Any member of the public in Canada has the right to communicate and receive available services in either official language. Refer to the Providing content in Canada\u2019s official languages page for more information.",
      "plain_text": "Official languages obligations The government must serve and communicate with the public in both official languages, as required by the Official Languages Act and its regulations, including the Official Languages (Communications with and Services to the Public) Regulations . Any member of the public in Canada has the right to communicate and receive available services in either official language. Refer to the Providing content in Canada\u2019s official languages page for more information."
